[h1]Sea Power: R.A.T.S. Clean Screen[/h1]
A very small mod. It switches off the game's own version label ("Sea Power v0.8.7-261107") that the Steam beta branch draws above everything. The label sat on top of the title bars of windows, on the map and on the windows of other mods, popped out ones included.

[h2]What it does[/h2]
[list]
[*]Keeps the game's version label off the screen.
[*]One setting, [b]Hide version label[/b] (on by default), in BepInEx\config\dev.sewerlabs.seapowercleanscreen.cfg. Off brings the game's label back.
[*]One file for both game versions (0.8.7 and the 3D globe beta). Checked offline against the files of both; not yet run in the game.
[*]It changes nothing else in the game.
[/list]

[h2]Install[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe, and switch Sea Power: R.A.T.S. Clean Screen on in the game's Mods menu.
[*]Needs R.A.T.S. Keel or Anchor Chain to run.
[*]Restart the game.
[/olist]

